# Next.js 16

- Build with Next.js 16, preferring the latest compatible stable release.
- Before writing Next.js code, read the relevant guide in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.
- Treat those local docs as authoritative because APIs and conventions may differ from earlier Next.js versions.
- Follow App Router, Server Component, caching, and request API conventions documented by the installed version.
- Heed deprecations and avoid relying on remembered behavior from older versions.
